{"product_id":"silver-bullets-a-lefty-mendieta-novel-1","title":"Silver Bullets (A Lefty Mendieta Novel (1))","description":"\u003cp\u003eTormented by past heartbreak and contemporary politics, for Edgar 'Lefty' Mendieta the news of the murder of lawyer Bruno Canizales represents just another day at the office in the drug-ridden city of Culiacán.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIt soon becomes clear that there is no shortage of suspects in a city where it's hard to tell the gangsters from the politicians. Canizales was the son of a former government minister and the partner of a drug baron's daughter, with his own penchant for cross-dressing and dangerous sex. What is less clear is why the assassin chose to use a silver bullet. And why, two days later, they seem to have struck again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIn this sweltering city where a desire for the truth can be as dangerous as any drug, Mendieta's search for justice takes him from mansions to drug dens, in Élmer Mendoza's seminal founding text of Latin America's 'narco-lit' wave.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Elmer Mendoza\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781681446134\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 13 x 197\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41763046326425,"sku":"16RB-1-9781681446134","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/silver-bullets-a-lefty-mendieta-novel-1-807556.jpg?v=1694791407","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/silver-bullets-a-lefty-mendieta-novel-1","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}